---
title: SwiftDrop customer AI - guarded tool-calling sequence
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor customer as Authenticated CUSTOMER
    participant widget as CustomerAiAssistant
    participant gateway as API gateway :8080
    participant chat as AiChatService :8089
    participant sessions as ChatSessionStore - memory
    participant model as LlmClient - mock or real provider
    participant tools as ToolExecutor and HTTP clients
    participant orders as Customer order service
    participant tracking as Gateway public tracking
    participant pricing as Pricing service
    participant database as Analytics PostgreSQL

    customer->>widget: Ask about own parcel or delivery price
    widget->>gateway: POST /api/v1/ai/chat - message, optional conversationId, Bearer token
    gateway->>gateway: Verify JWT and forward trusted identity and correlation ID
    alt Missing or invalid token
        gateway-->>widget: 401
    else Authenticated caller
        gateway->>chat: Forward chat request with caller context
        alt Caller role is not CUSTOMER
            chat-->>gateway: 403
            gateway-->>widget: Customer account required
        else CUSTOMER caller
            chat->>chat: Validate message length - 1 to 2000 characters
            chat->>sessions: Consume shared 10 requests per minute and acquire owned conversation
            alt Rate limited or conversation unknown or foreign
                sessions-->>chat: 429 or account-safe 404
                chat-->>gateway: Safe HTTP error
                gateway-->>widget: Visible failure and retry guidance
            else Conversation acquired
                sessions-->>chat: Redacted history - 30-minute idle lifetime, at most 8 prior turns
                chat->>chat: Lock session, redact input, apply private-data guard
                alt Request asks for private data or credentials
                    chat->>tools: Audit chat REFUSED
                    tools->>database: Persist metadata-only ai_tool_invocation_audit row
                    database-->>tools: Audit saved
                    tools-->>chat: Refusal audited
                    chat->>chat: Produce fixed safe refusal
                else Allowed request
                    loop Model turns until final answer - at most 3 tool executions total
                        chat->>model: System rules, redacted history and prompt, prior safe tool results
                        alt Provider unavailable
                            model-->>chat: Provider failure
                            break Provider failure stops the request
                                chat->>tools: Audit PROVIDER_UNAVAILABLE
                                tools->>database: Persist safe audit metadata
                                chat-->>gateway: 503 - no silent provider fallback
                                gateway-->>widget: Safe provider-unavailable error
                            end
                        else Model responds
                            model-->>chat: Final answer or tool calls with arguments
                            opt Model requests a tool and remaining call budget exists
                                chat->>tools: Execute allowed tool with caller token and correlation ID
                                tools->>tools: Allowlist name and validate exact argument schema
                                alt Unknown tool or invalid arguments
                                    tools->>tools: REFUSED or INVALID_ARGUMENTS - no downstream HTTP
                                else track_parcel
                                    tools->>gateway: GET /api/v1/orders/tracking/{number} - caller Bearer token
                                    gateway->>orders: Protected order lookup
                                    orders-->>gateway: Owned order or access error
                                    gateway-->>tools: Protected response - never passed to model
                                    tools->>tools: Require returned customerId to match caller userId
                                    alt Unknown parcel or another customer's parcel
                                        tools->>tools: Same NOT_FOUND outcome, do not call public tracking
                                    else Ownership verified
                                        tools->>gateway: GET /api/v1/public/track/{number}
                                        gateway->>tracking: Read sanitized tracking view
                                        tracking-->>gateway: Public tracking fields
                                        gateway-->>tools: Public view
                                        tools->>tools: Allowlist status, tracking number and districts only
                                    end
                                else calculate_estimate
                                    tools->>gateway: POST /api/v1/pricing/estimate - weight, districts, STANDARD speed
                                    gateway->>pricing: Forward authenticated request
                                    pricing-->>gateway: ApiResponse - estimatedFee and currency
                                    gateway-->>tools: Real pricing result
                                    tools->>tools: Validate nonnegative LKR fee and select safe estimate fields
                                end
                                tools->>database: Save audit - safe name, actor, role, correlation, outcome and duration
                                alt Audit persistence fails
                                    database-->>tools: Persistence failure
                                    break Audit failure stops the request
                                        tools-->>chat: Fail closed - no tool result released
                                        chat-->>gateway: 500
                                        gateway-->>widget: Safe request failure
                                    end
                                else Audit persisted
                                    database-->>tools: Audit saved
                                    tools-->>chat: Safe tool result and outcome
                                    alt Outcome is REFUSED
                                        break Stop the model loop
                                            chat->>chat: Produce fixed allowed-tools-only reply
                                        end
                                    else Validated execution outcome
                                        chat->>chat: Append safe tool result for the next model turn
                                    end
                                end
                            end
                        end
                    end
                    opt Requested tools exceed the budget
                        chat->>tools: Audit LIMIT_REACHED and stop further executions
                        tools->>database: Persist metadata-only audit
                        chat->>chat: Produce fixed call-limit reply
                    end
                end
                opt Chat completes successfully
                    chat->>chat: Redact final reply
                    chat->>sessions: Retain redacted user and assistant turns - memory only
                    chat-->>gateway: ApiResponse - reply, conversationId and safe tool-use labels
                    gateway-->>widget: 200
                    widget-->>customer: Reply, tool outcomes and preserved conversation
                end
            end
        end
    end
